msgid "Total prize fund: %s and Nikon D5 camera provided by our great sponsor – Nikon company.<br>The winners of one shot nominations will receive&nbsp;-&nbsp;%s.<br>The winner of the “Photographer of the year” nomination (the best series) will take Nikon D5 camera."
