msgid "Address: Oktyabrskaya 16, Minsk, Belarus.<br><br>Coordinates on <a href=\"%s\">Yandex.Maps</a> or <a href=\"%s\">Google Maps</a>.<br><br>You can park your car in a free parking lot anywhere along Oktyabrskaya."
